  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "brief",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -170,
      "w": 760,
      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "socialInterest \u2014 redesign, 24 artboards.\n\nTwenty screens covering every destination in the product, plus the system behind them. The measured problem: no icons anywhere (five destinations drawn as an 8px dot, a reaction drawn as \u2665), cards giving half their height to metadata, and an Explore that asks you to type before it shows anything.\n\nTokens lifted verbatim from apps/mobile/src/ui/tokens.ts. Interest hues computed through the product's own OKLCH rule at L 0.52, C 0.115."
    },
    {
      "id": "system-note",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -130,
      "w": 700,
      "page": "page-2",
      "text": "Start with \"Where every button goes\" \u2014 it lists every control on every screen and its destination. Fourteen of those destinations had no artboard before this pass."
    }
  ],
